/* //discord.gg/Coldz 
+ ========================================
+ FEATURES & ACTIVATION:
+ â€¢ Anti-Recoil (Vertical & Horizontal)
+   - Modes: ADS+Fire, ADS Only, Fire Only, ADS/FIRE
+   - Types: Traditional, Adaptive
+ â€¢ Aim Assist (Circular Pattern)
+   - Always active when enabled
+ â€¢ Rapid Fire
+   - Modes: OFF, FIRE, ADS+FIRE
+   - Quick Toggle: LT + Right D-Pad
+ â€¢ Pump Swap (Auto weapon swap after shot)
+   - Modes: OFF, FIRE, ADS+FIRE
+   - Quick Toggle: LT + Down D-Pad
+ â€¢ Bunny Hop (Auto jump while moving)
+   - Activates when holding A + moving stick 80+
+ â€¢ Sprint Dodge (Auto dodge roll while sprinting)
+   - Hold B + move stick while sprinting
+ â€¢ ADS Dodge (Dodge while aiming)
+   - Hold B + LT (ADS) + move stick
+ â€¢ Crouch Shot (Auto crouch when firing)
+   - Modes: OFF, TAP, HOLD
+   - Only works when NOT moving
+ ========================================
*/

